{"bgm":"bgm-cccp","chapter":1,"column":32,"description":"「임무를 완수하고 동료를 무사히 되돌려 보내겠다. 이것이 바로 크론시타트의 노스 유니온에 대한 충성이자 맹세다! 」","icon":"ChapterOne_22","id":48,"link_event":[49],"memory_id":[{"condition":"「깊게 울리는 메아리·상」 전역 시작","icon":"memory_shenduhuiyin1","id":2006,"is_open":0,"mask":"bg/bg_deepecho_1","number":0,"story":{"fadeOut":1.5,"fadeType":2,"fadein":1.5,"id":"SHENDUHUIYIN1","mode":2,"once":true,"scripts":[{"bgName":"bg_guild_blue_n","bgm":"bgm-cccp3","bgmDelay":1,"dir":1,"flashin":{"alpha":[1,0],"black":true,"delay":1,"dur":1},"flashout":{"alpha":[0,1],"black":true,"dur":1},"painting":{"alpha":0.3,"time":1},"say":"상트페테부르크-회의실","side":2},{"actor":900218,"bgName":"bg_guild_blue_n","dir":1,"expression":3,"nameColor":"#a9f548","painting":{"alpha":0.3,"time":1},"say":"——문서에 나와 있는 그대로입니다.","side":2},{"actor":900218,"bgName":"bg_guild_blue_n","dir":1,"expression":1,"nameColor":"#a9f548","painting":{"alpha":0.3,"time":1},"say":"노스 유니온은 메탈 블러드를 향해 육지, 공중, 수상, 수중 전방위적인 공격을 개시합니다.  메탈 블러드는 지금까지 제멋대로 행동한 결과에 책임을 질 때가 왔습니다.","side":2},{"actor":900218,"bgName":"bg_guild_blue_n","dir":1,"expression":3,"nameColor":"#a9f548","painting":{"alpha":0.3,"time":1},"say":"우리는 이번 공격을 시작으로 최선을 다해 이 길고도 무의미했던 분열에 의한 전쟁을 끝내려고 합니다.","side":2},{"actor":900218,"bgName":"bg_guild_blue_n","dir":1,"expression":1,"nameColor":"#a9f548","painting":{"alpha":0.3,"time":1},"say":"이것은 노스 유니온 최상부가 내린 결정이며, 동시에 노스 유니온의 굳건한 의지입니다.","side":2},{"actor":900218,"bgName":"bg_guild_blue_n","dir":1,"expression":3,"nameColor":"#a9f548","painting":{"alpha":0.3,"time":1},"say":"지휘부 전원의 동의를 받지 못하더라도 노스 유니온은 독단적으로라도 행동할 것입니다.","side":2},{"actor":900218,"bgName":"bg_guild_blue_n","dir":1,"expression":2,"nameColor":"#a9f548","painting":{"alpha":0.3,"time":1},"say":"——미래를 향해 나아갈 때가 됐습니다. 동의하십니까?","side":2},{"action":[{"delay":0,"dur":0.15,"number":2,"type":"shake","x":0,"y":45}],"actor":107030,"bgName":"bg_guild_blue_n","dir":1,"expression":4,"nameColor":"#a9f548","painting":{"alpha":0.3,"time":1},"paintingNoise":true,"s