me":"bg_guild_blue_n","dir":1,"expression":3,"nameColor":"#a9f548","painting":{"alpha":0.3,"time":1},"paintingNoise":true,"say":"사르데냐 엠파이어는 언제나 그랬듯 어떠한 반응도 없었어. 사쿠라 엠파이어도 마찬가지.","side":2},{"actor":205050,"bgName":"bg_guild_blue_n","dir":1,"expression":1,"nameColor":"#a9f548","painting":{"alpha":0.3,"time":1},"paintingNoise":true,"say":"하지만 사쿠라 엠파이어의 원정 함대 한 대가 여전히 다카르항 내에 주둔하고 있기 때문에 그들의 행동을 주시할 필요가 있어.","side":2},{"actor":205050,"bgName":"bg_guild_blue_n","dir":1,"nameColor":"#a9f548","painting":{"alpha":0.3,"time":1},"paintingNoise":true,"say":"물론 로열의 가장 큰 관심사는 \"휴전 협의가 끝나지 않은 상황에서 노스 유니온이 일방적으로 약속을 깨트릴 것인가?\"야.","side":2},{"actor":900218,"bgName":"bg_guild_blue_n","dir":1,"expression":3,"nameColor":"#a9f548","painting":{"alpha":0.3,"time":1},"say":"아뇨, 메탈 블러드 같은 짓은 하지 않을 겁니다.","side":2},{"actor":900218,"bgName":"bg_guild_blue_n","dir":1,"expression":1,"nameColor":"#a9f548","painting":{"alpha":0.3,"time":1},"say":"어느 정도의 정보 유출은 예상한 바입니다. 계획엔 전혀 영향이 없습니다.","side":2},{"actor":205050,"bgName":"bg_guild_blue_n","dir":1,"expression":2,"nameColor":"#a9f548","painting":{"alpha":0.3,"time":1},"paintingNoise":true,"say":"그러니까 어느 정도 선전포고를 한다는 거잖아… 이러한 행동들은 유럽 제국을 일촉즉발의 화약통으로 만드는 거야.","side":2},{"actor":205050,"bgName":"bg_guild_blue_n","dir":1,"expression":1,"nameColor":"#a9f548","painting":{"alpha":0.3,"time":1},"paintingNoise":true,"say":"이 일에 대해 스스로 알고 있는 거지?","side":2},{"actor":900218,"bgName":"bg_guild_blue_n","dir":1,"expression":3,"nameColor":"#a9f548","painting":{"alpha":0.3,"time":1},"say":"유럽 제국의 상황은 이미 오래전부터 위험한 상황이었어요. 중요한 건 누가 언제 불을 붙이냐죠.","side":2},{"actor":900218,"bgName":"bg_guild_blue_n","dir":1,"nameColor":"#a9f548","painting":{"alpha":0.3,"time":1},"say":"로열에선 주도권을 저쪽에 넘겨주기를 바라는 건가요?","side":2},{"actor":205050,"bgName":"bg_guild_blue_n","dir":1,"expression":1,"nameColor":"#a9f548","painting":{"alpha":0.3,"time":1},"paintingNoise":true,"say":"일리가 있는 걱정이야. 적색 중축을 대하는 태도를 두곤 로열은 원칙적으로 지지를 표해.","side":2},{"actor":205050,"bgName":"bg_guild_blue_n","dir":1,"exp